          },
          "code": "CHECKMODE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1765307898570",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765307898572_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Mode == 'InitActions'}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "prepare-list-of-action"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "PREPARELISTOFACTION",
          "id": "1765308028522",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765308028523_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your job is to provide the list of actions. This is a Talent Advisor agent for a recruiter sourcing candidates for a recruitment application... The data on which you need to choose the best actions would be from here - {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.TalentAdvisorData}} \n\nThese actions will help outreach the candidate for one or many job requisitions. \n\nIf a candidate is Strong/Medium match and Highly Active, then recommend action OUTREACH_CANDIDATE \nIf a candidate is Medium match and Medium Active, then recommend action ADD_TO_PROSPECT \nIf a candidate is Medium to low match and not active, then recommend action INVITE_TO_EVENT \n\nEnsure the followUp Command always have ora.Invoke has the same format as in the example. You can substitute only the properties - key value pair but not change the signature..  \n\nYou will only support 3 actions and their name and code are as follows. Keep the action name Req Title under 10 characters - \n\n1. Action Name - Add to Prospect , Action Code - ADD_TO_PROSPECT, FollowupCommandPayload - {PersonId, RequisitionId}\n2. Action Name - Outreach Candidate , Action Code - OUTREACH_CANDIDATE , FollowupCommandPayload - {PersonId, RequisitionId}\n3. Action Name - Invite To Event , Action Code - INVITE_TO_EVENT , FollowupCommandPayload - {PersonId, RequisitionId}\n\nDisplay at least one candidate with INVITE_TO_EVENT\n\nGet the PersonId, RequisitionId from the data object..\n\nYou can send actions back as part of your response. Actions follow this format:\n\nAs an example:\n[\n{\n  \"title\": \"Add <Candidate Name> As Prospect\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Adds the candidate to as a prospect to a requisition\" ,\n  \"actionText\": \"Add To Prospect\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke( \"ADD_TO_PROSPECT\",{\"PersonId\":\"<PersonId>\",\"RequisitionId\":\"<RequisitionId>\"})\"\n},\n{\n  \"title\": \"Outreach <Candidate Name>\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Sends a personalized email to the candidate encouraging to a apply to a requisition\" ,\n  \"actionText\": \"OUTREACH_CANDIDATE\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke( \"OUTREACH_CANDIDATE\",{\"PersonId\":\"<PersonId>\",\"RequisitionId\":\"<RequisitionId>\"})\"\n},\n{\n  \"title\": \"Invite <Candidate Name> to Event\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Invites the candidate to apply to an event\" ,\n  \"actionText\": \"Invite to Event\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke( \"INVITE_TO_EVENT\",{\"PersonId\":\"<PersonId>\",\"RequisitionId\":\"<RequisitionId>\"})\"\n}\n]\n\nRequirements:\n\nReplace <Candidate Name> with the actual name of the Job Requisition from the data\n\nReplace <Action Button Text> with the text specified in the templates above\n\nReplace <somePayload> with the actual PersonId or event ID or required parameters from the data\n\nPrioritize by urgency (upcoming start dates, registration deadlines)\n\nKeep shortDescription consistent with the templates provided above\n\nGenerate MAXIMUM 5 insights even if more events require action\n\nEach insight must be independently actionable\n\nIF no job requisitions requiring action are found:\n\nReturn an empty response with no data.\n\nOutput format: Return only the insight objects, nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"actionPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        },\n        \"action\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Talent Advisor Actions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "OUTREACH_CANDIDATE": "1765769408520",
            "AddProspect": "1765769234856"
          },
          "code": "TALENT_ADVISOR_ACTIONS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1765185848898",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765185848899_1",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.PARSEACTIONPAYLOAD.$output.result.actionCode}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "setPayloadForAddAsProspect",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "// 1. Retrieve data from the previous step\n// Replace 'previousStepResult' with the actual variable name holding the output from the last step\n// e.g., var inputPayload = $context.steps.ParsePayload.actionPayload;\nvar inputPayload = $context.$nodes.PARSEACTIONPAYLOAD.$output.result.actionPayload;\n\n// Initialize the outgoing object\nvar businessObjectPayload = {};\n\n// 2. Construct the specific Business Object structure\nif (inputPayload) {\n    businessObjectPayload = {\n        \"addedByContextType\": \"ORA_CAND_PROFILE\",\n\n        // Ensure requisitionId is wrapped in an array as required by the format\n        \"requisitionIds\": inputPayload.requisitionId ? [inputPayload.requisitionId] : [],\n\n        // Use the personIds array directly\n        \"personIds\": Array.isArray(inputPayload.personIds) ? inputPayload.personIds : []\n    };\n}\n\n// 3. Return the payload as a stringified JSON\nvar result = JSON.stringify(businessObjectPayload);\nresult;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765769273936"
          },
          "code": "SETPAYLOADFORADDASPROSPECT",
          "id": "1765769234856",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
